  "steps": [
   "Strip the kale from its stalks and shred finely. Put it in a large bowl with half the lemon juice and the salt, then scrunch with your hands for 2 minutes until dark and soft.",
   "Grate the carrots and shred the cabbage finely. Core the apples, cut them into thin matchsticks and toss in the rest of the lemon juice so they stay pale.",
   "Whisk the oil, honey and mustard in a small bowl with plenty of black pepper.",
   "Add the carrots, cabbage, apples and raisins to the kale, pour over the dressing and toss well. Leave for 10 minutes to settle.",
   "Scatter over the pumpkin seeds and serve in small bowls. The slaw keeps in the fridge for a day, so add the seeds to each serving."
